---
title: "db_backup_pipeline (stem-system: Clubhouse Manager)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_trigger: cron trigger (02:00 JST daily)
    q_trigger --> q_dump: pg_dump from SUPABASE_DB_URL
    q_dump --> q_error_dump: dump fails
    q_dump --> q_encrypt: dump succeeds
    q_error_dump --> [*]: workflow fails
    q_encrypt --> q_gpg: gpg --symmetric --cipher-algo AES256 with GPG_PASSPHRASE
    q_gpg --> q_push: push encrypted file to backup repository (BACKUP_REPO_TOKEN)
    q_push --> q_prune: delete backups older than 7 days
    q_prune --> [*]: backup complete

    note right of q_encrypt
        INV-001: backup is encrypted at rest with AES-256 symmetric encryption
        INV-002: GPG_PASSPHRASE must be stored as GitHub secret, never in code
    end note

    note right of q_prune
        INV-003: retention policy keeps exactly 7 days of backups
        INV-004: backup is stored in a separate repository from the application code
    end note
